{"seq":2,"slug":"litmus-chaos-mesh","title":"Litmus 与 Chaos Mesh：Kubernetes 原生混沌平台","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/chaos-engineering/platforms/litmus-chaos-mesh","wordCount":485,"readingTime":2,"html":"<h1 id=\"litmus-与-chaos-mesh-kubernetes-原生混沌平台\">Litmus 与 Chaos Mesh：Kubernetes 原生混沌平台</h1><p>随着 Kubernetes 成为容器编排的事实标准，混沌工程工具也进化为云原生形态。<strong>Litmus</strong>（CNCF 孵化项目）和 <strong>Chaos Mesh</strong>（CNCF 沙盒项目）是两个最主流的 Kubernetes 原生混沌平台，通过 CRD（Custom Resource Definition）定义混沌实验，与 Kubernetes 生态深度集成。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ChaosExperiment（Litmus）</td>\n<td>定义故障注入逻辑的 CRD 资源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ChaosEngine（Litmus）</td>\n<td>将实验与目标应用绑定的执行控制器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ChaosResult</td>\n<td>记录实验执行结果和稳态度量的资源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ChaosWorkflow</td>\n<td>编排多个实验的工作流，支持串行和并行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Chaos Mesh Dashboard</td>\n<td>Chaos Mesh 提供的 Web UI，可视化管理实验</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"litmus-架构\">Litmus 架构</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    UI[Litmus Portal UI] --&gt; OC[Chaos Operator\\n控制器]&#10;    OC --&gt; CE[ChaosEngine CRD\\n目标+实验绑定]&#10;    CE --&gt; EX[ChaosExperiment CRD\\n具体故障逻辑]&#10;    EX --&gt; POD[实验 Pod\\n在目标 namespace 执行]&#10;    POD --&gt; TARGET[目标应用 Pod]&#10;    POD --&gt; RESULT[ChaosResult CRD\\n记录结果]\">flowchart TB\n    UI[Litmus Portal UI] --&gt; OC[Chaos Operator\\n控制器]\n    OC --&gt; CE[ChaosEngine CRD\\n目标+实验绑定]\n    CE --&gt; EX[ChaosExperiment CRD\\n具体故障逻辑]\n    EX --&gt; POD[实验 Pod\\n在目标 namespace 执行]\n    POD --&gt; TARGET[目标应用 Pod]\n    POD --&gt; RESULT[ChaosResult CRD\\n记录结果]</pre><h2 id=\"litmus-安装与配置\">Litmus 安装与配置</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 安装 Litmus Operator&#10;kubectl apply -f https://litmuschaos.github.io/litmus/litmus-operator-v3.0.0.yaml&#10;&#10;# 验证安装&#10;kubectl get pods -n litmus&#10;# 期望输出: chaos-operator-ce-xxx Running&#10;&#10;# 安装通用实验集（Generic Chaos Experiments）&#10;kubectl apply -f https://hub.litmuschaos.io/api/chart/generic/experiments.yaml -n default\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 安装 Litmus Operator</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> apply</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://litmuschaos.github.io/litmus/litmus-operator-v3.0.0.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 验证安装</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> get</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pods</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> litmus</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 期望输出: chaos-operator-ce-xxx Running</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 安装通用实验集（Generic Chaos Experiments）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> apply</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://hub.litmuschaos.io/api/chart/generic/experiments.yaml</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> default</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"litmus-实验示例-pod-随机删除\">Litmus 实验示例：Pod 随机删除</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: litmuschaos.io/v1alpha1&#10;kind: ChaosEngine&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: payment-chaos&#10;  namespace: default&#10;spec:&#10;  appinfo:&#10;    appns: default&#10;    applabel: &#39;app=payment-service&#39;&#10;    appkind: deployment&#10;&#10;  # 稳态假说验证&#10;  annotationCheck: &#39;true&#39;&#10;  engineState: &#39;active&#39;&#10;&#10;  chaosServiceAccount: litmus-admin&#10;&#10;  experiments:&#10;    - name: pod-delete&#10;      spec:&#10;        components:&#10;          env:&#10;            - name: TOTAL_CHAOS_DURATION # 实验总时长（秒）&#10;              value: &#39;60&#39;&#10;            - name: CHAOS_INTERVAL # 删除间隔（秒）&#10;              value: &#39;10&#39;&#10;            - name: PODS_AFFECTED_PERC # 受影响 Pod 百分比&#10;              value: &#39;50&#39;&#10;            - name: FORCE # 是否强制删除（SIGKILL）&#10;              value: &#39;false&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">litmuschaos.io/v1alpha1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ChaosEngine</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">payment-chaos</span></span>\n<span 