an>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'500'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">JITTER</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 抖动毫秒数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'100'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">TOTAL_CHAOS_DURATION</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'120'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">PODS_AFFECTED_PERC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'33'</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"chaos-mesh-安装与使用\">Chaos Mesh 安装与使用</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# Helm 安装 Chaos Mesh&#10;helm repo add chaos-mesh https://charts.chaos-mesh.org&#10;helm install chaos-mesh chaos-mesh/chaos-mesh \\&#10;  --namespace=chaos-mesh \\&#10;  --create-namespace \\&#10;  --set controllerManager.replicaCount=1 \\&#10;  --version 2.6.0&#10;&#10;# 验证安装&#10;kubectl get pods -n chaos-mesh\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Helm 安装 Chaos Mesh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">helm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> repo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> chaos-mesh</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://charts.chaos-mesh.org</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">helm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> chaos-mesh</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> chaos-mesh/chaos-mesh</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --namespace=chaos-mesh</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --create-namespace</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --set</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> controllerManager.replicaCount=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --version</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2.6.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 验证安装</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> get</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pods</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> chaos-mesh</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>NetworkChaos：注入网络延迟</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: chaos-mesh.org/v1alpha1&#10;kind: NetworkChaos&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: payment-network-delay&#10;  namespace: default&#10;spec:&#10;  action: delay&#10;  mode: one # 随机选择一个 Pod&#10;  selector:&#10;    namespaces:&#10;      - default&#10;    labelSelectors:&#10;      &#39;app&#39;: &#39;payment-service&#39;&#10;  delay:&#10;    latency: &#39;300ms&#39;&#10;    correlation: &#39;25&#39;&#10;    jitter: &#39;50ms&#39;&#10;  duration: &#39;60s&#39;&#10;  direction: to # 注入方向: to/from/both\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">chaos-mesh.org/v1alpha1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">NetworkChaos</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">payment-network-delay</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  namespace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">default</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">delay</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  mode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">one</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 随机选择一个 Pod</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  selector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    namespaces</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">default</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    labelSelectors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      'app'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'payment-service'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  delay</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    latency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'300ms'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    correlation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'25'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    jitter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'50ms'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  duration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'60s'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  direction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">to</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 注入方向: to/from/both</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>PodChaos：Kill Pod</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: chaos-mesh.org/v1alpha1&#10;kind: PodChaos&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: pod-kill-example&#10;spec:&#10;  action: pod-kill&#10;  mode: fixed-percent&#10;  value: &#39;25&#39; # 终止 25% 的匹配 Pod&#10;  selector:&#10;    namespaces:&#10;      - default&#10;    labelSelectors:&#10;      &#39;app&#39;: &#39;payment-service&#39;&#10;  gracePeriod: 0&#10;  duration: &#39;30s&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">chaos-mesh.org/v1alpha1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">PodChaos</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pod-kill-example</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pod-kill</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  mode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">fixed-percent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'25'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 终止 25% 的匹配 Pod</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  selector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    namespaces</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">default</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    labelSelectors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      'app'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'payment-service'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  gracePeriod</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  duration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'30s'</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"litmus-vs-chaos-mesh-对比\">Litmus vs Chaos Mesh 对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Litmus</th>\n<th>Chaos Mesh</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CNCF 状态</td>\n<td>孵化（Incubating）</td>\n<td>沙盒（Sandbox）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实验定义方式</td>\n<td>ChaosEngine + ChaosExperiment</td>\n<td>独立 CRD（NetworkChaos/PodChaos...）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工作流支持</td>\n<td>原生支持（基于 Argo Workflows）</td>\n<td>需配合外部工具</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>故障类型</td>\n<td>90+ 预置实验</td>\n<td>15+ 核心类型，扩展性强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UI</td>\n<td>Litmus Portal（功能丰富）</td>\n<td>Chaos Mesh Dashboard</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学习曲线</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>较低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>企业特性</td>\n<td>较完整</td>\n<td>基础版</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"关键实践清单\">关键实践清单</h2><ul>\n<li>首次部署时在独立的测试 namespace 验证，确认实验按预期执行</li>\n<li>为混沌实验 ServiceAccount 配置最小权限（RBAC）</li>\n<li>设置 ChaosResult 的告警：实验失败（稳态偏离）时通知 on-call</li>\n<li>将 Chaos Workflow 纳入 GitOps 管理（存储在 Git，通过 ArgoCD 部署）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Litmus 和 Chaos Mesh 将混沌工程与 Kubernetes 生态深度融合，通过 CRD 让故障注入变成可声明、可版本化的代码。Litmus 功能更完整、工作流支持更好；Chaos Mesh 更轻量、上手更快。两者都适合 Kubernetes 原生环境，选择取决于团队规模和功能需求。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Litmus 与 Chaos Mesh：Kubernetes 原生混沌平台","id":"litmus-与-chaos-mesh-kubernetes-原生混沌平台"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Litmus 架构","id":"litmus-架构"},{"level":2,"text":"Litmus 安装与配置","id":"litmus-安装与配置"},{"level":2,"text":"Litmus 实验示例：Pod 随机删除","id":"litmus-实验示例-pod-随机删除"},{"level":2,"text":"Chaos Mesh 安装与使用","id":"chaos-mesh-安装与使用"},{"level":2,"text":"Litmus vs Chaos Mesh 对比","id":"litmus-vs-chaos-mesh-对比"},{"level":2,"text":"关键实践清单","id":"关键实践清单"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Chaos Monkey 与 Simian Army","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/chaos-engineering/platforms/chaos-monkey-simian-army"},"next":{"title":"AWS FIS 与商业混沌工程平台","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/chaos-engineering/platforms/aws-fis-commercial"}}